    <item>
      <title>Version 1.4.3</title>
      <sparkle:version>10403</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A playlist that failed now turns green once you clear out or re-download the songs that failed — the badge tracks what's actually in the playlist instead of freezing on the original result</li>
          <li>New banner on a failed playlist to retry or remove all the failed songs at once, instead of right-clicking them one at a time</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:10:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure
