      />
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Version 1.4.1</title>
      <sparkle:version>10401</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed downloads failing with "HTTP Error 403: Forbidden" — the bundled YouTube downloader was out of date</li>
          <li>Fixed long playlists stalling partway through and never finishing</li>
          <li>Fixed progress bars staying at 0% for the whole download</li>
          <li>Added: add a single song to an existing playlist by pasting its link</li>
          <li>Added: remove, delete, or re-download individual songs in a playlist</li>
          <li>Added: playlists now surface audio files you dropped into their folder yourself</li>
          <li>Added: optional browser cookies setting so age-restricted songs can download from your signed-in YouTube session</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:20:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/austinlackey/Music-Downloader/releases/download/v1.4.1/Music-Downloader-1.4.1.zip"
        length="58289937"
        type="application/octet-stream"
        sparkle:edSignature="wfC4EQIqFToaYzUa93KOh1PvWesHFwM9HI/JN0wkORu0eFVkkselTT6KqnGZgS3CHZlIxMbodqYXPq31AchTBw=="
      />
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Version 1.4.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>10400</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Playlists containing deleted, private, or region-blocked videos now finish successfully instead of failing the whole download</li>
          <li>Songs YouTube no longer serves are collected into their own banner, each with the reason, and left out of progress and completion totals</li>
          <li>Fixed a hang when a playlist contained many unavailable videos</li>
          <li>Unexpected yt-dlp errors are still reported in full rather than being mistaken for missing videos</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 14:36:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/austinlackey/Music-Downloader/releases/download/v1.4.0/Music-Downloader-1.4.0.zip"
